        <p>FOR DANISH. KIEL BUTTER, SMOKED WILTSHIRE. IRISH ROLL AND HOME-CURED BACON. , PRIME CHESHIRE; CH HESE, In fact for Gerwral GROCnaIIES AND PROVISIONS At Prices to SUIT all try E. DOWNES,</p>
