        <p>THE St. Selena Exannner and Preseot Weekly News, published Friday afternoon. The district comprises the centre of the Glass, Chemical, and Watch Trades of the King- dom. &amp;c. THE _Runcorn Examiner, published Friday after- noon. It is the only Weekly Paper in the district. and affers the best and cheapest facilities to advertisers. THE Widnos Examiner, published Friday after' noon. Widnes contains the largest number of Chemical Works of any town in the kingdom, and is rapidly becoming an important centre of industry.</p>
