        <p>Has an established reputation for Riving Careful and Prompt Attention to the wants of all Customers: and its facilities for the production of Good Work of every kind—from the smallest typographic trifia to the biggest mural " Mammoth " are available to the public, at prices which are strictly monerate. Careless, inartistic, and slovenly printing is the bane of business men. They find it doesn't pay to have it—even at " the lowest tender."</p>
