        <head>BILLIARDS.</head>
        <p>BILLIARDS.</p>
        <p>The return billiard match between" Ye Crackers " of Liverpool, and members of the Conservative Club, was played on Saturday. Previous to the match an excellent knife and fork tea was partaken of by the players. The match created considerane interest among the members, to whom "Ye Crackers" are well known, they having visited the club on several occasions, and for the amuse- ment of the members have given excellent concerts dur- ing the winter months. The games were well contested. the result being a victory for the home team by 22 points, the scores are as follow "YE CRACKERS." EARLESTOWN. W A Hollis lOO G Wright H Reynolds Wli Hughes B7 F Brierley lOO R Brunton 100 T Bowes J Puv.mire B7 W A Mawdsley 100 J H Moscrop 100 J Howe</p>
